B16. Survey the current state-of-the-art(SOTA) solutions in cybersecurity.
Shift cybersecurity defences to continuous and automated resilience.

1. Autonomous security operations and AI defence
Traditional security operations centers are overwhelmed by alert fatigue. State-of-the-art solutions for that by delpoying automated AI SOCs using specialized models that use as security agents.
SOTA solutions deploy automated models which capable of continuous predictive threat modeling and instant micro quarantining without monitoring. 
Furthermore, by using Agentic AI, Identify and Access Management has improved to manage and update machine identities, tracking credentials and permissions in real time.


2. Zero trust 
This SOTA solution bases on a stict principle of 'never trust, always verify' that implements Identity Mediated Access based on NIST SP 800-207. 
Instead of granting access at login, system calculates continuously based on device health, user behavior and context of every individual APL call or document access request.
